Package: sfcopula
Type: Package
Title: Copula Driven Analysis of Spatial and Spatio-Temporal Data Based on 'sf' and 'stars'
Version: 0.1-0
Date: 2026-10-08
Authors@R: c(person("Benedikt", "Graeler", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "b.graeler@52north.org"),
             person("Marius", "Appel", role = "ctb"))
Maintainer: Benedikt Graeler <b.graeler@52north.org>
Description: A framework to analyse multivariate, spatial and spatio-temporal
  data via copulas, vine copulas and hierarchical Kendall copulas. It is the
  successor of the 'spcopula' package: spatial data is provided as simple
  features ('sf') and spatio-temporal data as vector data cubes ('stars') with
  a geometry and a time dimension. Additionally, support for calculating
  different multivariate return periods based on copulas and vine copulas is
  implemented.
